{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29f8049433a2743992adf2642346c143804a1d098b2ffdc05e1a875f8f2c05fd", "ja": "（今日は息抜きに、みんなでテニス！\n経験者の静香は、特に気合いが入っているみたいだ）", "zh": "（今天大家一起打网球放松一下！有经验的静香，似乎尤其干劲十足）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "ced207e243d9234841a1c262b0234a460f8d1453bb3585d54c065332ffbc8e86", "ja": "{$P$}、いい天気ですね！\n今日は思いっきり動けそうです。", "zh": "{$P$}，天气真好啊！\n今天可以尽情活动一下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cce93e91036b83b3b5fa6f60e5b45d6813fc7e58e2382a9ddd579dda83704ca6", "ja": "ずいぶん張り切ってるじゃないか。\nやっぱり、テニスが好きなんだな。", "zh": "你还真是干劲十足啊。果然，你很喜欢网球呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "08327d5f3a00eda42189712dd1cb6c6aff2558fe6484b9b44cb1d69c5074f216", "ja": "そうですね。それに……最近は忙しくて、\nあまり時間も取れませんでしたから。", "zh": "是啊。而且……最近一直很忙，也没能抽出多少时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "163b59d8733913679c49864a785aa17c81403db4af0a261bbd1399b997f314c0", "ja": "今日は、しばらくできなかった分、\n全力で打ち込みたいなって。", "zh": "今天想把之前一段时间没能练习的份，全力投入进去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1005_p", "source_sha256": "10369da2f110f83325c696b1364ed52bf6b9f51d88c6279e47b2c4ee6ca42fd4", "ja": "なるほどな。それならやっぱり目標は、\n全員に勝つこと……とかかな？", "zh": "原来如此。那样的话，目标果然是赢过所有人……之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc3e63460e591b5dea9f669e1245796ea739964892ecac364f975c09801aa0b5", "ja": "確かに、勝てたらうれしいとは思いますけど……\n勝負にはこだわりたくないんです。", "zh": "确实，能赢的话当然很开心……\n但我不想太执着于胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1007_p", "source_sha256": "624f00436b96abded34f44e646dbda49905b34c09d3d9a972b3e53324af193f3", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか……なんか意外だな。\n絶対に負けません、って言うかと思ったよ。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗……总觉得有点意外啊。\n我还以为你会说“绝对不会输”之类的话呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "50d7aca3d1192402c9bab5e22a32b15c980e8052d49aa08ab84541b4450b363b", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n私のこと、どんな性格だと思ってるんですか……？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n您觉得我是个什么性格的人啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "356f4eb4b5ae536bd468b2489c57347e7577ea24055dc154668dfe7927e2c6fb", "ja": "試合だったらわかりますけど、今日は息抜きですし。\nみんなと一緒に、ただ楽しく遊びたいんです。", "zh": "比赛的话我理解，但今天是来放松的。\n我只是想跟大家一起开开心心地玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c99af6a5b109876db08824ff11a85259fbb0de9c8f450fd2673bfa895d33746e", "ja": "ああ、そうだよな……。\n今日はみんなで楽しもうって話だったもんな。", "zh": "啊，是啊……\n今天本来就是说好要和大家一起开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "82ec05385c57428792fed9bc791bf01d4fb8e071f30ba759b72df02dd001fe33", "ja": "ええ。たまにはレッスンや仕事を忘れて、\n楽しむ時間も必要ですから。", "zh": "是啊。偶尔也需要忘记练习和工作，享受一下快乐时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "3cb076c73def3e5be2b13ab70391ae24c7024682364595ad73805b862fbe6678", "ja": "なので、{$P$}。あの、\nよかったら……後で、私と試合しませんか？", "zh": "所以，{$P$}。那个，如果你愿意的话……之后要不要和我比赛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5aa2dc5a05920b898412cbbba849e007c19d401a740fe9feaccd0869c95816b0", "ja": "もちろん！　って言っても、静香の相手が務まるかな？\nラリーが続くかどうかも怪しいような……。", "zh": "当然可以！不过话是这么说，不知道我够不够格当静香的对手啊。\n感觉连能不能打上几个来回都很难说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "6f6797783460695fb0430122dd30d414acd895eece2cabb0ffd172f1c52de03d", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ。さっき言ったじゃないですか。\n今日は遊びたいだけだって。", "zh": "没事的。我刚才不是说了吗？\n今天只是想玩一玩而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "90f10dbb2be5233e3579daa80f8c3255ee40367a2962c98e19a1034e73b91a9d", "ja": "それに、もし難しそうなら、私がレッスンしますから。\nラケットの握り方から教えてあげますよ。", "zh": "而且，如果看起来有困难的话，我来教你练习。\n我会从球拍的握法开始教你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a7c0118cd2d7d7ba8d63fe3b7d569907016a60e9394433bbb6d7bc28bd6f8575", "ja": "おっ、助かるよ。\nよろしくお願いします、最上先生。", "zh": "哦，那可帮大忙了。\n那就拜托你了，最上老师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "009d2760b0e4690eca44460a9e6c7ed4b0dbacf62386d3e1a0d23c11e6d3096a", "ja": "えっ！？　や、やめてくださいよ！\nちょっと教えるだけですから……もう！", "zh": "诶！？请、请别这样啦！\n我只是稍微教你一下而已……真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "f6d65ff614567486d178dc865a3be31f6a865e7ecb187e8ce2c76239e38f5e97", "ja": "い、言っておきますけど、教えるのに手加減は\nしませんから。覚悟してくださいね！", "zh": "先、先说好，教的时候我可不会\n手下留情的。请做好心理准备吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0273_1019_p", "source_sha256": "60f4b84c9f09acc57803b4d0c622928617530baf40f76f38d32b1fab0d9754e5", "ja": "（その後、静香にみっちりレッスンしてもらった。\nふぅ……楽しくテニスできたな！）", "zh": "（之后，静香给我进行了严格的训练。呼……打网球打得真开心啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
